  "description": "Actipro Avalonia is a free set of UI controls and modern themes for building beautiful Avalonia applications.\n\nThe optional ColorPicker themes (ActiproSoftware.Controls.Avalonia.Themes.ColorPicker package) and DataGrid themes (ActiproSoftware.Controls.Avalonia.Themes.DataGrid package) libraries are not included in this package, and must be referenced separately if needed.\n\nThe commercial Actipro Avalonia Pro bundle contains even more advanced controls and functionality that complement our free Avalonia offerings.  Reference the ActiproSoftware.Controls.Avalonia.Pro package instead to access that bundle.\n\nDocumentation is available on the Actipro web site (https://www.actiprosoftware.com/docs/controls/avalonia/index?v=25.2), and samples can be downloaded from the Actipro Avalonia Controls GitHub repository (https://github.com/Actipro/Avalonia-Controls).",
